  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Yang Feng of Ancient Soul Sect tells Immortal Monkey King Shi Lei that three hundred thousand years ago, during the Medieval Antiquity Era, a sect ancestor became friends with this Eastern Sea Gu Immortal at a Gu refinement path convention. They competed in refining Gu for eighty-one days, each taking victories, closely matched, and agreed that the winner would obtain the loser’s creation. Red emperor wine was created by Wine Emperor and lost to that ancestor. Shi Lei already knows the name as famous in human history.",
      "chapters": [
        1191
      ],
