    {
      "text": "Legend says that combining those eight wines can obtain rank eight liquor worm Immortal Gu, which can turn rank eight white litchi immortal essence into rank nine yellow apricot immortal essence. After Wine Emperor died he left an inheritance. The Eastern Sea Gu Immortal Zui Xian Weng became the one hundred and thirty-seventh inheritor.",
